participant "LangGraph Runtime Executor\nResponsibility: Coordinate the proposal pipeline\nContract: Prepared state in; proposal package out\n[[../../../../ai_stack/langgraph/runtime_executor/public.py source]]\n[[../components/c4-component.puml drill-down]]" as executor
