retrieval -> context_pack : "builds\ncontract: ranked and budgeted context\n[[../../../../ai_stack/rag/rag_context_pack_assembler.py source]]"
context_pack -> director : "supplies bounded context\ncontract: ranked citations and continuity facts\n[[../../../../ai_stack/langgraph/langgraph_runtime_executor_impl.py source]]"

